 payables:{options:['Yes; the materials are purchased again when paid.','No; payment reduces cash and the existing supplier liability.','Yes; supplier payments are always expenses.'],correct:1,feedback:'The purchase records supplies and accounts payable. Later payment settles the liability; it does not acquire the same materials again.'},
